Package: distributions7
Title: S7 Framework for Probability Distributions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Giovanni", "Tinervia", , "giovannitinervia9@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a consistent S7 object-oriented infrastructure for probability distributions. Each 'distrib' object encapsulates standard statistical functions alongside analytical derivatives.
